1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,800
It's Diwali... will you come?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,800
Every new beginning needs a little sweetness. Happy Diwali!

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,800
I come to every home where hearts are honest. Happy Diwali.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,800
Let your light be knowledge, and your words be kind. Happy Diwali.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,800
Light one lamp for every friend... and one more for me! Happy Diwali!

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,800
Jai Shri Ram! My Lord is coming home! Happy Diwali!

7
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,800
No darkness is stronger than one brave flame. Happy Diwali.

8
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:38,800
Let old anger burn away, like oil in the lamp. Happy Diwali.

9
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:43,800
Stand tall, little warrior. Your light is your strength. Happy Deepavali!

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,500
On this night, Lord Rama came home, and the whole world lit lamps to welcome him.

11
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Happy Diwali, everyone!

12
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:59,500
God lights the first lamp. The rest are ours to light.
